      <div class="cmp-cell" role="cell">El aceite de los 40</div>
      <div class="cmp-cell is-center" role="cell"><svg class="ic ok" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="11"/><path d="M7.2 12.2 10.4 15.4 16.9 8.9"/></svg>Lo neutraliza en cada baño</div>
      <div class="cmp-cell" role="cell"><svg class="ic no" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="11"/><path d="M8 8l8 8M16 8l-8 8"/></svg>Le pasa por encima</div>
