      <div class="cmp-cell" role="cell"><svg class="ic no" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="11"/><path d="M8 8l8 8M16 8l-8 8"/></svg>El desodorante no llega</div>
